<h1>Myathe Magick Studio</h1>
<p>Myathe Magick Studio is a personal desktop dashboard used privately by Myathe Magick, the owner of this website, to review their own creative projects and connected-channel performance. It combines read-only reports with content planning and visual trends.</p>
<p class="studio-notice">This page provides information about Studio. The dashboard, connected accounts, reports, and credentials are not publicly accessible through this website. Studio is not offered here as a public service.</p>
<h2>What Studio does</h2>
<p>Studio brings together connected-account reports, local charts and comparisons, and content planning. Its Google integrations read YouTube channel and video statistics, YouTube Analytics reports, and Google Analytics reports for the owner’s website and Substack publication.</p>
<p>Google authorization is optional and initiated by the owner through Google’s sign-in and consent flow in their browser. Google access is read-only: the current integration does not upload videos, edit content, or change Analytics settings.</p>
<h2>Privacy and contact</h2>
<p><a href="/studio/privacy/">Read the Studio privacy policy</a> for details about data access, local storage, deletion, and revoking authorization.</p>
<p>Operator: Myathe Magick. For questions about Studio or its data practices, contact <a href="mailto:myathe.magick@gmail.com">myathe.magick@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</StudioInformation>
